#, kde-format
msgid "Incorrect password"
msgstr "Neispravna lozinka"

#: kuickquiz.cpp:161
#, kde-format
msgid "The password you have supplied was incorrect. Please try again."
msgstr ""
"Lozinka koju ste isporučili je bila pogrešna. Molimo pokušajte ponovno."

#: kuickquiz.cpp:319
#, kde-format
msgid "A supplied password did not match."
msgstr "Isporučena lozinke se ne podudara."

#: kuickquiz.cpp:319
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Either the new passwords do not match, or the old password was incorrect."
msgstr ""
"Ili  se nove lozinke se ne podudaraju, ili je stara lozinka bila pogrešana."

#: kuickquiz.cpp:340
#, kde-format
msgid "Quiz for %1"
msgstr "Kviz za %1"

#: kuickquiz.cpp:342
#, kde-format
msgid "No quiz name has been specified"
msgstr "Kviz bez imena je specificirana"

#: kuickquiz.cpp:346
#, kde-format
msgid "The quiz cannot be done because no questions exist."
msgstr "Kviz se ne može učiniti, jer ne postoje pitanja."

#: kuickquiz.cpp:349
#, kde-format
msgid "Do this quiz"
msgstr "Uradi ovaj kviz"

#: kuickquiz.cpp:355
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"No scores have been entered yet.\n"
"Do the quiz to receive some results."
msgstr ""
"Jos nema unesenih rezultata.\n"
"Uradi ovaj kviz da dobijemo neke rezultate."

#: kuickquiz.cpp:366
#, kde-format
msgid "Position %2 : 1 point scored by %3 \n"
